	(text "The antenna end overhangs the board edge with a 5 mm keep-out toward an RF-transparent\nenclosure wall (D-265's edge rule becomes D-270's face rule). Scan the advertisement\nalways; open FFE1 only when cell detail is wanted; never write. FEE7 and any DFU\ncharacteristic are never touched - that is the door to a bricked pack (D-330, D-345)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 762 485.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "446a2a29-234e-4491-9714-94f847a0df87")
	)
	(text "the open-collector output is pulled up to +3V3, NOT to +5 V - that is what\nlets a comparator running on 5 V drive a 3.3 V-only input safely"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 411.48 0)
