	(text "U1 - the ICU's 5 V buck in full (work F13; record icu_channels IC12, parts P105 / P159).\nTI LMR36015-Q1 datasheet SNVSAY8D, typical application for 5 V: every value confirm until the part is chosen.\nLayout: input caps tight across both VIN/PGND pairs, SW copper short, CBOOT from BOOT to the SW-NC link,\nthe feedback parts right at FB, AGND and PGND to the ground pour through vias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 586.74 0)
		(effects
