	(text "Two 12 V inputs, and they never meet on this board: two inputs, two diodes (D-273).\nA net tie joining +12V_LOGIC to +12V_BL is not a drawing error to tidy up later - it is the\nerror the two-diode design exists to prevent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 20.32 0)
