	(text "+3V3 is the Teensy's own 3.3 V output, arriving at the socket. There is NO 3.3 V\nregulator on this carrier: D-273 put the radio on the XIAO module's own LDO because a\nBLE scan peaks near 300 mA and the Teensy's regulator is a 250 mA part. TARGET.md\nsection 1 still says 'LDO for the ESP32-C3' - the CSV wins and this sheet follows it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
